          "description": "After losing my father just weeks before Father's Day, I decided to turn my grief into something positive. I created a 30+ page Yoto MYO Scavenger Hunt bundle with original MP3s and a PDF with 12+ activities in his memory - with instructions!\n\n- Download the PDF with the full 30+ page bundle\n- Link the MP3s to a MYO card\n- Add an included label to the MYO card if you'd like\n- Choose what you'd like to print, or print it all\n- Cut\n- Set up the scavenger hunt around your home\n- Make memories!",
